    {
      "subId": "48406",
      "subQuestName": "(test)奇怪的标记（已改为开车）$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4840601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4840601": {
            "id": "4840601",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "这是…碎掉的布片，有风元素的痕迹。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4840602"
            ]
          },
          "4840602": {
            "id": "4840602",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "看图案和编织方式，可能是风之翼的碎片。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4840603"
            ]
          },
          "4840603": {
            "id": "4840603",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这样就能看出来是风之翼了吗？不愧是侦察骑士。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4840604"
            ]
          },
          "4840604": {
            "id": "4840604",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "嗯，如果真是怪鸟，那他的风之翼应该已经坏掉了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
